<view class="page">

  <!-- 顶部左上角：当前对战下拉筛选（有空间才显示，但 hero 占位始终保留，防止卡片上移） -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-drop" wx:if="{{hasSpace}}" bindtap="openSpaceSheet">
      <text class="hd-name">{{me}}</text>
      <text class="hd-vs">VS</text>
      <text class="hd-name">{{friend}}</text>
      <text class="caret">▾</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 无空间：空状态引导 -->
  <view wx:if="{{!hasSpace}}" class="card empty-card">
    <view class="big">🏟️</view>
    <view class="empty-txt">还没有比赛空间</view>
    <view class="empty-sub">创建一个空间，或输入朋友分享的邀请码，两个人就能看到同一份战绩</view>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="goJoin">创建 / 加入空间</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <!-- 双人 VS 卡 -->
    <view class="card vs-card">
      <view class="vs-col">
        <view class="avatar">{{meAvatar}}</view>
        <view class="vs-name">{{me}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vs-mid">
        <view class="vs-word">VS</view>
        <view class="vs-ball">🎱</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vs-col">
        <view class="avatar">{{frAvatar}}</view>
        <view class="vs-name">{{friend}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 最近战绩 -->
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>最近战绩</text>
        <text class="lead">{{leadText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="rec-bar">
        <view class="rec-line">
          <text class="rec-name">{{me}}</text>
          <text class="rec-win">{{mWin}} 胜</text>
          <text class="rec-sep">·</text>
          <text class="rec-win">{{fWin}} 胜</text>
          <text class="rec-name right">{{friend}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="rate-track">
          <view class="rate-fill" style="width: {{mRate}}%;"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="rec-total">最近 {{total}} 场</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 主按钮 -->
    <button class="btn-primary big-btn" bindtap="goRecord">＋ 记录一场</button>

    <!-- 最近比赛 -->
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>最近比赛</text>
        <text class="link" bindtap="goStats">查看统计 ›</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{recent.length === 0}}" class="empty">
        <view class="big">🎱</view>
        还没有比赛，点上面的按钮记一场吧
      </view>

      <view
        wx:for="{{recent}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        class="rec-item"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="goDetail"
      >
        <view class="rec-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</view>
        <view class="rec-main">
          <view class="rec-score">
            <text class="rec-me">{{item.meName}}</text>
            <text class="rec-num">{{item.a}} : {{item.b}}</text>
            <text class="rec-fr">{{item.friendName}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="rec-meta">
            <text>{{item.timeText}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.loc}}"> · {{item.loc}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="badge {{item.winClass}}">{{item.winnerText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 选择朋友弹层 -->
  <view wx:if="{{spaceSheet}}" class="mask" bindtap="closeSpaceSheet"></view>
  <view wx:if="{{spaceSheet}}" class="sheet">
    <view class="sheet-title">选择朋友</view>
    <scroll-view class="space-scroll" scroll-y>
      <view
        wx:for="{{spaces}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        class="space-item {{item.cur ? 'on' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="pickSpace"
      >
        <view class="space-avatar">{{item.emoji}}</view>
        <view class="space-main">
          <view class="space-name">
            {{item.name}}
            <text class="tag-def" wx:if="{{item.isDef}}">默认</text>
            <text class="tag-cur" wx:if="{{item.cur}}">当前</text>
          </view>
          <view class="space-sub">{{item.count}} 场战绩 · 邀请码 {{item.inviteCode}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="space-right">
          <view
            wx:if="{{!item.isDef}}"
            class="sp-def"
            data-id="{{item._id}}"
            catchtap="setDefaultSpace"
          >设为默认</view>
          <view wx:else class="space-check">{{item.cur ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{spaces.length === 0}}" class="space-empty">还没有空间，先创建一个吧</view>
    </scroll-view>
    <button class="btn-primary full-width" bindtap="goJoin">＋ 创建新空间 / 加入空间</button>
    <button class="sheet-close cancel-btn" bindtap="closeSpaceSheet">取消</button>
  </view>

  <!-- 首次设置昵称引导：无昵称时强制弹出，遮罩不可关闭 -->
  <view wx:if="{{onboarding}}" class="mask" catchtap="noop"></view>
  <view wx:if="{{onboarding}}" class="sheet ob-sheet">
    <view class="ob-title">先设置你的昵称</view>
    <view class="ob-sub">朋友在战绩里会看到这个名字</view>

    <!-- 微信昵称一键填入：聚焦后点「使用微信昵称」即可带入真实昵称 -->
    <input
      class="name-input"
      type="nickname"
      value="{{obNickname}}"
      placeholder="点这里可一键填入微信昵称"
      placeholder-class="ph"
      maxlength="32"
      bindinput="obOnNameInput"
      bindnickname="obOnNickname"
    />
    <view class="name-tip">点输入框 → 选「使用微信昵称」即可自动填入；也可手动改</view>

    <view class="avatar-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{obAvatarList}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="avatar-item {{obAvatar === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="obPickAvatar"
      >{{item.emoji}}</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary ob-save" bindtap="obSave" disabled="{{obSaving}}">保存并进入</button>
  </view>

</view>
